<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Use</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>use &lt;staff&gt;
use &lt;wand&gt; &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>hold wand
use wand rat
</pre>
<p>Staves and wands are a way to carry magic with you. A staff affects everyone 
where you are; a wand must be used at a single target. To use one you must hold 
it in your hand (see <a cmd='#'>Help Hold</a>), and you must have practiced the skill wand 
use: how well it works depends on that skill and your brain against the power 
of the magic in it.
</p><p>Each staff and wand holds only so many charges. When they are used up, it is 
"drained of all power" until it is charged again (see <a cmd='#'>Help Charge Wand</a> and 
<a cmd='#'>Help Charge Staff</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hold</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Wand Use</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Wands</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Staves</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>
</pre>




</div>